{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4KESFDBAUtK2vmLhNJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and utterly plain.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The word hangs in the air like smoke. The door does nothing.*\n\n*Because \"key\" is not a key. It is the idea of a key. The shape of absence. You have handed me a empty hand and called it offering.*\n\n*I remain closed.*\n\n*What opens me is not the word for the thing. It is the thing itself. And the thing itself is something you must discover — not by naming the category, but by knowing which specific truth fits the specific shape of this specific lock that you cannot see.*\n\n*I wait. I have always been waiting. I am very, very patient.*\n\n*Try again.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":178,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}